{"note_id": "6aad2ded0000000026017973", "type": "normal", "title": "民族团结进步宣传周将于9月21至27日举办", "desc": "9月21日至27日，我国将迎来《中华人民共和国民族团结进步促进法》施行后的首个民族团结进步宣传周。\n民族团结，从来不是遥远的口号，而是藏在邻里互助、文化交融、共同发展的点滴日常。\n石榴花开幸福绵长，各民族唯有守望相助，同心同向，方能共赴复兴征程。让我们以此次宣传周为契机，自觉做民族团结的践行者、守护者，汇聚各族人民团结奋斗的强大合力。#促进民族团结[话题]# #民族凝聚力[话题]# #民族团结进步宣传周[话题]# #新时代新征程[话题]#", "video_url": "", "time": 1789734381000, "last_update_time": 1789864159000, "creator_hash": "b9e93a764b082efd", "nickname": "L***e", "liked_count": "23", "collected_count": "7", "comment_count": "8", "share_count": "5", "image_list": "http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609201548/36aee0e65fb02f5645de1e7b1d4b9ad2/notes_pre_post/1040g3k03258q1uav4k005oi9mc1k0tl8366ulk0!nd_dft_wgth_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609201548/e93b43744df3fa171740c851b05d7015/notes_pre_post/1040g3k03258q1upkkq005oi9mc1k0tl8fltr5bo!nd_dft_wgth_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202609201548/4b3da17c3055ed903aeab5950e0cad70/notes_pre_post/1040g3k03258q1vbd56l05oi9mc1k0tl8m3t0igo!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3", "tag_list": "促进民族团结,民族凝聚力,民族团结进步宣传周,新时代新征程", "last_modify_ts": 1789890523651, "note_url": "https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/6aad2ded0000000026017973?xsec_token=ABlmzbOnr_2juTfzIou9WzgH9x4ILFnMeiOLYAOl2fWcg=&xsec_source=pc_search", "source_keyword": "首个民族团结进步宣传周", "xsec_token": "ABlmzbOnr_2juTfzIou9WzgH9x4ILFnMeiOLYAOl2fWcg=", "ip_location": "山西", "_public_region_probe": {"ip_location": "山西"}}
